msgid "BASIC"
msgstr "BASIC"

msgid ""
"BASIC as it was on the first home computers, with its guide beside it: write "
"a program, press Run, and see. It draws, colours and sounds too."
msgstr ""
"BASIC como en los primeros ordenadores de casa, con su guía al lado: escribe "
"un programa, pulsa Ejecutar y mira. También dibuja, colorea y suena."

msgid "Type it in for me"
msgstr "Escríbemelo"

msgid ""
"A button under each program of the guide types it into the editor. Off, the "
"child types every program."
msgstr ""
"Un botón debajo de cada programa de la guía lo escribe en el editor. Si está "
"apagado, el niño escribe todos los programas."

msgid "Run"
msgstr "Ejecutar"

msgid "Run the program (Ctrl+Enter)"
msgstr "Ejecutar el programa (Ctrl+Intro)"

msgid "Stop"
msgstr "Parar"

msgid "Stop the program (Escape)"
msgstr "Parar el programa (Escape)"

msgid "New"
msgstr "Nuevo"

msgid "Save"
msgstr "Guardar"

msgid "Open"
msgstr "Abrir"

msgid "The program"
msgstr "El programa"

msgid "The screen"
msgstr "La pantalla"

msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Sí"

msgid "No"
msgstr "No"

msgid "The program in the editor will be lost. Go on?"
msgstr "Se perderá el programa del editor. ¿Seguimos?"

msgid "program"
msgstr "programa"

msgid "The program is running. Escape stops it."
msgstr "El programa está funcionando. Escape lo para."

msgid "The program has ended."
msgstr "El programa ha terminado."

msgid "You stopped the program."
msgstr "Has parado el programa."

msgid "The program is in the editor. Press Run to see it."
msgstr "El programa está en el editor. Pulsa Ejecutar para verlo."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Line {number} jumps to line {target}, and the program has no line {target}."
msgstr ""
"La línea {number} salta a la línea {target}, y el programa no tiene línea "
"{target}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "BASIC does not understand line {number}."
msgstr "BASIC no entiende la línea {number}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "BASIC does not understand line {line} of the editor."
msgstr "BASIC no entiende la línea {line} del editor."

msgid ""
"Something is missing at the end of the program: a NEXT for a FOR, perhaps, "
"or a closing quote."
msgstr ""
"Falta algo al final del programa: quizá el NEXT de un FOR, o unas comillas "
"que cierren."

msgid "A READ found no more DATA to read."
msgstr "Un READ no ha encontrado más DATA que leer."

msgid ""
"The program stopped at a mistake BASIC cannot name. Look for a RETURN "
"without its GOSUB, or a NEXT without its FOR."
msgstr ""
"El programa se ha parado en un error que BASIC no sabe nombrar. Busca un "
"RETURN sin su GOSUB, o un NEXT sin su FOR."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The program stopped: {message}"
msgstr "El programa se ha parado: {message}"

msgid "Back"
msgstr "Atrás"

msgid "Next"
msgstr "Siguiente"

msgid "Chapters"
msgstr "Capítulos"

msgid "For the adult"
msgstr "Para el adulto"
